 ><strong>Different\u00a0races\u00a0have\u00a0different\u00a0cities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each\u00a0planet\u00a0has\u00a0a\u00a0central\u00a0city.\u00a0The\u00a0construction\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0city\u00a0relies\u00a0on\u00a0various\u00a0functional\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buildings\u00a0which\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0choose\u00a0and\u00a0place\u00a0freely.\u00a0Some\u00a0buildings\u00a0are\u00a0directly\u00a0related\u00a0to\u00a0the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >development\u00a0direction\u00a0of\u00a0the\u00a0planet.\u00a0Additionally,\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0visit\u00a0other\u00a0allies'\u00a0cities\u00a0within\u00a0the\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alliance\u00a0to\u00a0learn\u00a0from\u00a0their\u00a0layout\u00a0arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.poster.avif?t=1743472926\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.webm?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347310/extras/b24ea615a7c3a7f821a307537f22c2b4.mp4?t=1743472926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore\u00a0and\u00a0expand\u00a0the\u00a0alliance's\u00a0territory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As\u00a0an\u00a0individual\u00a0player,\u00a0you\u00a0can\u00a0develop\u00a0additional\u00a0planets\u00a0to\u00a0enhance\u00a0your\u00a0economic\u00a0power.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As\u00a0part\u00a0of\u00a0an\u00a0alliance,\u00a0everyone\u00a0works\u00a0together\u00a0to\u00a0expand\u00a0influence\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0area,\u00a0integrating\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the\u00a0p